1
00:00:18,480 --> 00:00:19,320
Baby.

2
00:00:19,760 --> 00:00:20,360
Come here.

3
00:00:22,720 --> 00:00:23,320
You said

4
00:00:23,320 --> 00:00:24,780
you'd handle everything,

5
00:00:24,920 --> 00:00:26,780
but left it all to Eason in the end.

6
00:00:27,320 --> 00:00:29,760
Sister Hu told Eason to follow me 24/7.

7
00:00:30,160 --> 00:00:30,960
I rehearse every day,

8
00:00:30,960 --> 00:00:32,290
and he has nothing to do.

9
00:00:32,479 --> 00:00:34,010
At least he's not bored now.

10
00:00:36,680 --> 00:00:38,080
Thanks for your hard work.

11
00:00:38,080 --> 00:00:39,280
It's fine, Director.

12
00:00:39,560 --> 00:00:41,680
I actually quite enjoy the process.

13
00:00:43,960 --> 00:00:44,240
Here,

14
00:00:44,240 --> 00:00:44,560
have some more.

15
00:00:44,560 --> 00:00:45,040
Oh no!

16
00:00:45,320 --> 00:00:46,640
Jinxi's head is gone!

17
00:00:47,560 --> 00:00:48,000
What?

18
00:00:55,320 --> 00:00:55,960
Xiao Qi,

19
00:00:56,360 --> 00:00:57,880
you scared us to death.

20
00:00:57,880 --> 00:00:58,840
Xiao Qi,

21
00:00:59,120 --> 00:01:01,580
can you finish your sentences in the future?

22
00:01:02,080 --> 00:01:03,760
This isn't the first time.

23
00:01:03,760 --> 00:01:05,820
It was taken down a couple of days ago.

24
00:01:06,080 --> 00:01:07,410
Could a fan have done it?

25
00:01:07,760 --> 00:01:08,760
That's unlikely.

26
00:01:08,880 --> 00:01:10,539
I've been keeping watch here.

27
00:01:10,960 --> 00:01:12,890
Jin Xi really has all kinds of fans.

28
00:01:13,360 --> 00:01:16,360
It must be some classless person who snuck in at night.

29
00:01:17,360 --> 00:01:19,420
Forget it. We'll just print a new one.

30
00:01:19,920 --> 00:01:21,320
Actually, Jinxi's rehearsal location

31
00:01:21,320 --> 00:01:22,560
among us fans

32
00:01:22,560 --> 00:01:23,760
is not a secret at all.

33
00:01:23,920 --> 00:01:25,320
But we've always followed the rules

34
00:01:25,320 --> 00:01:27,050
and would never do such a thing.

35
00:01:27,280 --> 00:01:27,800
Yeah.

36
00:01:29,560 --> 00:01:30,160
Really?

37
00:01:30,160 --> 00:01:31,160
Of course.

38
00:01:31,280 --> 00:01:32,680
After the theater incident last time,

39
00:01:32,680 --> 00:01:33,920
didn't Sister Hu scold us?

40
00:01:33,920 --> 00:01:34,360
Yeah.

41
00:01:34,360 --> 00:01:36,560
We've tightened our internal discipline.

42
00:01:36,560 --> 00:01:38,280
And look, Jinxi has been rehearsing for so long,

43
00:01:38,280 --> 00:01:39,960
when have we ever sneaked a peek?

44
00:01:39,960 --> 00:01:40,440
Right.

45
00:01:41,759 --> 00:01:42,960
You don't believe us?

46
00:01:43,000 --> 00:01:44,479
Then don't drink our tea.

47
00:01:44,560 --> 00:01:45,759
And don't eat our snacks either.

48
00:01:45,759 --> 00:01:46,640
Don't listen to our music.

49
00:01:46,640 --> 00:01:47,440
Don't listen to the music either.

50
00:01:47,440 --> 00:01:48,770
Don't sit on our chairs.

51
00:01:49,360 --> 00:01:49,920
Don't sit on the chairs either.

52
00:01:49,920 --> 00:01:50,320
Goodbye.

53
00:01:50,320 --> 00:01:50,640
Go.

54
00:01:50,640 --> 00:01:51,320
Why are you so stingy?

55
00:01:51,320 --> 00:01:52,180
Hurry up and go.

56
00:01:54,880 --> 00:01:55,210
Okay.

57
00:01:56,200 --> 00:01:57,400
Sorry, and thank you.

58
00:02:02,640 --> 00:02:04,640
The hospital can't take in any more.

59
00:02:04,960 --> 00:02:07,560
We can only try to find people to adopt them ourselves.

60
00:02:07,560 --> 00:02:08,160
It's fine.

61
00:02:08,479 --> 00:02:09,840
Our theater troupe has so many people.

62
00:02:09,840 --> 00:02:10,919
We won't have to worry about no one adopting them.

63
00:02:10,919 --> 00:02:11,760
Them?

64
00:02:17,079 --> 00:02:20,120
Bai Feixin's place is so cluttered there's no room to step.

65
00:02:20,120 --> 00:02:22,380
The kitten could easily be buried alive.

66
00:02:22,440 --> 00:02:23,640
It's a safety hazard.

67
00:02:26,240 --> 00:02:28,079
What about Jiaoye and Eldest Cousin?

68
00:02:28,079 --> 00:02:29,480
Jiaoye and Eldest Cousin

69
00:02:30,200 --> 00:02:32,240
are perfectly fine when apart.

70
00:02:32,960 --> 00:02:33,880
But...

71
00:02:36,920 --> 00:02:39,560
I told you not to add honey to the pear juice.

72
00:02:39,920 --> 00:02:41,000
I didn't.

73
00:02:41,680 --> 00:02:43,680
Do you think I have no sense of taste?

74
00:02:43,960 --> 00:02:45,240
I made you pear juice,

75
00:02:45,640 --> 00:02:47,300
and I still have to apologize?

76
00:02:47,560 --> 00:02:50,040
I'm not mad about whether you added honey.

77
00:02:50,040 --> 00:02:51,920
I'm mad that you clearly added it,

78
00:02:51,920 --> 00:02:53,520
but lied and said you didn't.

79
00:02:54,160 --> 00:02:56,020
Give it to me if you won't drink it.

80
00:02:56,120 --> 00:02:56,880
Mengtejiao.

81
00:02:58,120 --> 00:02:59,920
If they are together,

82
00:03:00,360 --> 00:03:02,560
it's like a ticking time bomb.

83
00:03:02,960 --> 00:03:04,360
Then the kitten is very likely

84
00:03:04,360 --> 00:03:06,490
to be like the paper cup in their hands.

85
00:03:07,560 --> 00:03:08,490
Absolutely not.

86
00:03:10,560 --> 00:03:12,560
Then Jianshe should be fine, right?

87
00:03:13,320 --> 00:03:14,840
Jianshe lives an exquisite life

88
00:03:14,840 --> 00:03:16,360
and is emotionally stable.

89
00:03:16,360 --> 00:03:17,920
Heying's emotional stability

90
00:03:17,920 --> 00:03:20,920
is built on the foundation of an exquisite life.

91
00:03:22,240 --> 00:03:24,840
Keeping a cat will disrupt his exquisite life.

92
00:03:25,760 --> 00:03:26,320
For instance,

93
00:03:26,320 --> 00:03:27,480
that well-preserved

94
00:03:27,480 --> 00:03:28,920
Liaozhai he's holding.

95
00:03:29,480 --> 00:03:32,160
If it gets a tuft of cat hair on it,

96
00:03:32,160 --> 00:03:34,290
his emotions won't be stable anymore.

97
00:03:35,440 --> 00:03:37,370
Then Xiaoqi should be fine, right?

98
00:03:40,240 --> 00:03:42,640
Xiaoqi is indeed the most ideal candidate.

99
00:03:43,880 --> 00:03:46,540
But her landlord doesn't allow her to keep pets.

100
00:03:47,120 --> 00:03:49,160
Then how about asking them to check with people around them

101
00:03:49,160 --> 00:03:50,760
if they're willing to adopt?

102
00:03:51,280 --> 00:03:52,410
That's all we can do.

103
00:03:53,360 --> 00:03:56,620
I don't have time to ask around about adopting a cat for you.

104
00:03:57,079 --> 00:03:58,610
What cat is up for adoption?

105
00:03:58,760 --> 00:04:00,240
Then help me ask Mr. Wu

106
00:04:00,240 --> 00:04:01,960
if anyone wants to adopt a kitten.

107
00:04:01,960 --> 00:04:02,820
He is asking you

108
00:04:03,000 --> 00:04:04,860
if anyone wants to adopt a kitten.

109
00:04:06,840 --> 00:04:08,840
I have a niece.

110
00:04:09,480 --> 00:04:11,280
Ning Jin, I asked my friend for you.

111
00:04:11,280 --> 00:04:13,320
She's been wanting a second cat recently.

112
00:04:13,320 --> 00:04:13,920
Director.

113
00:04:14,120 --> 00:04:15,560
My friend runs a cat cafe.

114
00:04:15,560 --> 00:04:17,560
She says she can take in a new member.

115
00:04:18,320 --> 00:04:20,640
Actually, our colleague is also very interested in your cat.

116
00:04:20,640 --> 00:04:22,360
He often asks me for pictures of the kittens.

117
00:04:22,360 --> 00:04:23,020
I mean Andy.

118
00:04:23,120 --> 00:04:23,440
Ah.

119
00:04:23,440 --> 00:04:23,880
Yeah.

120
00:04:23,880 --> 00:04:25,480
Andy also really likes cats.

121
00:04:25,640 --> 00:04:26,700
You can talk to him.

122
00:04:31,320 --> 00:04:33,560
Mr. Wu said his niece also wants to adopt.

123
00:04:33,560 --> 00:04:34,480
Who told him?

124
00:04:34,880 --> 00:04:36,240
I asked Hu to tell him.

125
00:04:36,240 --> 00:04:38,040
There are so many people interested now.

126
00:04:38,040 --> 00:04:40,170
There aren't enough cats to go around.

127
00:04:41,159 --> 00:04:41,680
Okay.

128
00:04:41,880 --> 00:04:43,560
But they all have to pass my interview

129
00:04:43,560 --> 00:04:44,480
so I can know

130
00:04:44,480 --> 00:04:46,280
if they are qualified adopters.

131
00:04:49,560 --> 00:04:50,760
Good kitty.

132
00:04:57,760 --> 00:04:58,720
Where are you from?

133
00:04:58,720 --> 00:04:59,250
Chengdu.

134
00:04:59,760 --> 00:05:01,040
How many people are in your family?

135
00:05:01,040 --> 00:05:01,840
Three.

136
00:05:01,840 --> 00:05:02,360
How old are you?

137
00:05:02,360 --> 00:05:03,320
I'm 20 this year.

138
00:05:03,320 --> 00:05:03,760
23.

139
00:05:03,760 --> 00:05:04,080
24.

140
00:05:04,680 --> 00:05:05,400
What's your major?

141
00:05:05,400 --> 00:05:06,120
Chinese Language and Literature.

142
00:05:06,120 --> 00:05:07,280
Broadcasting and Hosting.

143
00:05:07,280 --> 00:05:08,440
Do you live alone now?

144
00:05:08,440 --> 00:05:08,840
Alone.

145
00:05:09,080 --> 00:05:10,240
Have you ever had a pet?

146
00:05:10,240 --> 00:05:10,920
I've never had a pet before.

147
00:05:10,920 --> 00:05:11,840
I kept one for three months.

148
00:05:11,840 --> 00:05:12,760
I looked after it for a friend.

149
00:05:12,760 --> 00:05:13,760
If you had three cats,

150
00:05:13,760 --> 00:05:14,880
what would you name them?

151
00:05:14,880 --> 00:05:15,440
Laicai,

152
00:05:15,440 --> 00:05:16,170
and Yuanbao.

153
00:05:16,560 --> 00:05:18,160
If all three cats fell into the water at the same time,

154
00:05:18,160 --> 00:05:19,120
which one would you save first?

155
00:05:19,120 --> 00:05:19,580
I'd save

156
00:05:19,680 --> 00:05:20,160
Laicai.

157
00:05:20,160 --> 00:05:21,160
What about Yuanbao and Xiaobai?

158
00:05:21,160 --> 00:05:21,760
My mom would save them.

159
00:05:21,760 --> 00:05:22,960
How many relationships have you had?

160
00:05:22,960 --> 00:05:23,640
About five.

161
00:05:23,640 --> 00:05:24,320
How long was the longest?

162
00:05:24,320 --> 00:05:24,960
And the shortest?

163
00:05:24,960 --> 00:05:26,320
Seven months at most.

164
00:05:26,520 --> 00:05:27,560
One week at least.

165
00:05:28,360 --> 00:05:29,960
The longest is only seven months.

166
00:05:29,960 --> 00:05:31,960
Then how can you guarantee you'll be responsible for a cat?

167
00:05:31,960 --> 00:05:34,320
I feel like humans can't give me a sense of security,

168
00:05:34,320 --> 00:05:35,080
but cats can.

169
00:05:36,080 --> 00:05:37,760
Because I think cats suit me better.

170
00:05:37,760 --> 00:05:38,560
Wait a minute.

171
00:05:39,320 --> 00:05:41,480
You keep saying how well you dance.

172
00:05:41,480 --> 00:05:44,080
What does dancing have to do with keeping a cat?

173
00:05:45,240 --> 00:05:47,240
But I'm here to audition as a dancer.

174
00:05:52,360 --> 00:05:54,240
Then go prepare a dance routine.

175
00:05:54,840 --> 00:05:55,400
Okay.

176
00:05:57,680 --> 00:05:58,340
Be careful.

177
00:05:59,360 --> 00:06:00,890
So why did you install this?

178
00:06:01,640 --> 00:06:02,360
Last night,

179
00:06:02,360 --> 00:06:04,840
nobody emptied the trash can in our rehearsal room, right?

180
00:06:04,840 --> 00:06:07,700
When I came this morning, there was nothing inside.

181
00:06:07,960 --> 00:06:09,240
I asked the cleaner.

182
00:06:09,800 --> 00:06:11,330
She didn't empty it either.

183
00:06:11,920 --> 00:06:13,580
Does it matter who emptied it?

184
00:06:14,760 --> 00:06:17,760
There was Mr. Heying's delivery box in the trash can,

185
00:06:18,760 --> 00:06:20,620
and Bai Feixin's snack wrappers.

186
00:06:20,960 --> 00:06:22,020
Most importantly,

187
00:06:22,760 --> 00:06:24,560
Jinxi's mask was in it.

188
00:06:25,640 --> 00:06:26,900
You remember all that?

189
00:06:27,240 --> 00:06:27,840
Director,

190
00:06:28,200 --> 00:06:29,560
don't you get it?

191
00:06:30,120 --> 00:06:32,440
It must be that pervert who cut the poster,

192
00:06:32,440 --> 00:06:34,700
pushing his luck to steal Jinxi's trash.

193
00:06:35,440 --> 00:06:37,370
So I bought a surveillance camera.

194
00:06:37,520 --> 00:06:39,040
We have to catch him.

195
00:06:47,120 --> 00:06:47,920
So,

196
00:06:48,120 --> 00:06:48,760
Director,

197
00:06:49,240 --> 00:06:49,760
can this

198
00:06:50,000 --> 00:06:51,159
be reimbursed?

199
00:06:54,320 --> 00:06:56,880
24K ultra-HD 360-degree,

200
00:06:56,880 --> 00:06:59,440
AI facial recognition night vision camera.

201
00:07:02,960 --> 00:07:05,760
I should be able to take this home to monitor my cat.

202
00:07:05,880 --> 00:07:08,210
Director, so it can be reimbursed, right?

203
00:07:09,080 --> 00:07:10,680
Could it be Judy?

204
00:07:11,120 --> 00:07:11,880
Judy?

205
00:07:12,400 --> 00:07:13,360
I don't think so.

206
00:07:13,360 --> 00:07:14,960
Does Jingjing look like one?

207
00:07:14,960 --> 00:07:16,080
Jingjing is pretty honest.

208
00:07:16,080 --> 00:07:17,360
I also think she's quite honest.

209
00:07:17,360 --> 00:07:18,560
Then it must be Watson.

210
00:07:18,560 --> 00:07:19,040
No.

211
00:07:19,960 --> 00:07:20,480
Hello.

212
00:07:20,480 --> 00:07:20,880
Feixin.

213
00:07:20,880 --> 00:07:21,480
Hello.

214
00:07:21,480 --> 00:07:22,560
Hello, everyone.

215
00:07:23,920 --> 00:07:25,760
Are you Jin Xi's fans?

216
00:07:27,120 --> 00:07:28,520
What are you doing...

217
00:07:28,680 --> 00:07:30,760
Isn't there a weird person recently?

218
00:07:32,960 --> 00:07:33,560
A sasaeng.

219
00:07:34,200 --> 00:07:34,920
No.

220
00:07:34,920 --> 00:07:35,840
It's not like that.

221
00:07:35,840 --> 00:07:37,360
Those people aren't even considered fans.

222
00:07:37,360 --> 00:07:39,120
We fans are very rational.

223
00:07:39,120 --> 00:07:41,580
Those people have psychological problems.

224
00:07:41,760 --> 00:07:43,600
They don't see themselves and Xi

225
00:07:43,600 --> 00:07:45,120
as fans and idols.

226
00:07:45,120 --> 00:07:47,680
Instead, they treat him as their private property.

227
00:07:47,680 --> 00:07:48,560
They objectify him.

228
00:07:48,560 --> 00:07:49,880
It's so scary.

229
00:07:49,880 --> 00:07:51,480
That's really scary.

230
00:07:51,960 --> 00:07:52,159
Well...

231
00:07:52,159 --> 00:07:53,400
You guys carry on.

232
00:07:53,680 --> 00:07:54,080
Alright.

233
00:07:54,080 --> 00:07:54,880
I'll get going now.

234
00:07:54,880 --> 00:07:55,240
Bye.

235
00:07:55,360 --> 00:07:55,960
Feixin.

236
00:07:55,960 --> 00:07:58,240
Bye.

237
00:07:58,760 --> 00:08:00,890
It's about time I go pick up my brother.

238
00:08:01,360 --> 00:08:02,960
Then we'll go with you to shoot something.

239
00:08:02,960 --> 00:08:03,360
Well...

240
00:08:03,360 --> 00:08:03,960
Sure.

241
00:08:04,040 --> 00:08:05,360
Just keep your distance.

242
00:08:05,360 --> 00:08:06,090
Don't worry.

243
00:08:11,480 --> 00:08:12,120
Excuse me.

244
00:08:13,880 --> 00:08:14,600
Could you tell me

245
00:08:14,600 --> 00:08:16,660
if Jin Xi has finished his rehearsal?

246
00:08:17,480 --> 00:08:18,840
You're his fan, right?

247
00:08:18,840 --> 00:08:19,440
Sorry.

248
00:08:19,440 --> 00:08:22,370
It's not convenient to share his personal schedule.

249
00:08:22,680 --> 00:08:23,760
I'm not his fan.

250
00:08:24,080 --> 00:08:25,000
I'm his...

251
00:08:27,640 --> 00:08:28,760
Anyway.

252
00:08:28,760 --> 00:08:30,960
I have a very important private matter with him.

253
00:08:30,960 --> 00:08:32,620
So could you take me to see him?

254
00:08:34,760 --> 00:08:36,220
It's not very convenient.

255
00:08:36,480 --> 00:08:38,539
Besides, I'm not that close to Jin Xi.

256
00:08:40,280 --> 00:08:41,480
Are you Bai Feixin?

257
00:08:41,840 --> 00:08:43,169
Aren't you his partner?

258
00:08:43,760 --> 00:08:45,620
Don't worry. I'm not a bad person.

259
00:08:48,080 --> 00:08:49,560
Don't think I don't know what kind of person you are.

260
00:08:49,560 --> 00:08:50,840
You're exactly what they call...

261
00:08:50,840 --> 00:08:51,600
that kind of...

262
00:08:51,600 --> 00:08:52,530
I'm warning you.

263
00:08:52,680 --> 00:08:54,760
Stay away from our Xiyin Theatre Troupe and Jin Xi.

264
00:08:54,760 --> 00:08:56,120
This is just a warning.

265
00:08:56,120 --> 00:08:57,840
If there's a next time, I won't be polite.

266
00:08:57,840 --> 00:08:58,280
No.

267
00:08:58,480 --> 00:08:58,840
I...

268
00:09:05,960 --> 00:09:06,600
Feixin,

269
00:09:06,800 --> 00:09:07,680
are you okay?

270
00:09:08,240 --> 00:09:08,970
Are you okay?

271
00:09:09,840 --> 00:09:10,170
Here,

272
00:09:10,560 --> 00:09:11,490
have some water.

273
00:09:16,440 --> 00:09:17,320
Why are you here?

274
00:09:17,320 --> 00:09:18,440
Of course I had to come.

275
00:09:18,440 --> 00:09:20,360
I was only on a business trip for two days and such a big thing happened.

276
00:09:20,360 --> 00:09:21,090
Are you okay?

277
00:09:21,360 --> 00:09:22,120
Where are you hurt?

278
00:09:22,120 --> 00:09:23,640
She...

279
00:09:24,040 --> 00:09:25,360
The one who got hurt is me.

280
00:09:25,360 --> 00:09:27,320
Fortunately, I brought pepper spray with me,

281
00:09:27,320 --> 00:09:28,520
so nothing happened.

282
00:09:28,920 --> 00:09:30,120
Eason, you really...

283
00:09:30,320 --> 00:09:32,320
You didn't explain it to me clearly.

284
00:09:32,840 --> 00:09:34,320
I heard that these past two days,

285
00:09:34,320 --> 00:09:37,760
there are two or three fans making trouble in the troupe.

286
00:09:38,360 --> 00:09:40,040
Thank goodness nothing major happened.

287
00:09:40,040 --> 00:09:41,700
I apologize to everyone here.

288
00:09:41,880 --> 00:09:42,680
I'm sorry.

289
00:09:43,120 --> 00:09:45,920
It's not just a matter of the past two or three days.

290
00:09:46,160 --> 00:09:48,360
Every day since we started rehearsing,

291
00:09:48,640 --> 00:09:50,560
there have been three weird fans

292
00:09:50,560 --> 00:09:51,960
blocking the door.

293
00:09:52,360 --> 00:09:53,920
I suggest you kick them out.

294
00:09:54,560 --> 00:09:57,360
Those three haven't done anything terrible.

295
00:09:57,520 --> 00:09:59,680
They haven't even entered the building.

296
00:09:59,680 --> 00:10:01,360
Where else can we chase them to?

297
00:10:01,360 --> 00:10:03,240
Who knows if they cut the poster?

298
00:10:03,240 --> 00:10:04,640
They also steal garbage.

299
00:10:04,640 --> 00:10:05,160
Yeah.

300
00:10:05,360 --> 00:10:07,040
Bai Feixin and Jin Xi acted together,

301
00:10:07,040 --> 00:10:08,370
and they were attacked.

302
00:10:08,920 --> 00:10:10,520
You have quite a good temper.

303
00:10:10,560 --> 00:10:11,320
If it were me,

304
00:10:11,560 --> 00:10:12,920
I'd call the cops on him

305
00:10:13,440 --> 00:10:14,760
so he wouldn't come back.

306
00:10:14,760 --> 00:10:15,440
Come back?

307
00:10:15,920 --> 00:10:16,680
No way.

308
00:10:17,040 --> 00:10:17,970
Didn't you know?

309
00:10:18,360 --> 00:10:19,560
These toxic solo fans

310
00:10:19,640 --> 00:10:21,500
hate it when couples are shipped.

311
00:10:22,960 --> 00:10:24,560
Hitting you is getting off lightly.

312
00:10:24,560 --> 00:10:26,040
Be careful, they might stalk you

313
00:10:26,040 --> 00:10:27,770
and splash paint on your house.

314
00:10:28,960 --> 00:10:29,680
So,

315
00:10:30,160 --> 00:10:32,320
you should be responsible for the fans' behavior.

316
00:10:32,320 --> 00:10:33,400
I assure everyone,

317
00:10:33,760 --> 00:10:36,160
this kind of thing will absolutely not happen again.

318
00:10:36,160 --> 00:10:37,800
We'll strengthen security.

319
00:10:38,240 --> 00:10:39,600
Then the past incidents,

320
00:10:39,600 --> 00:10:41,120
are just written off like that?

321
00:10:41,120 --> 00:10:42,720
What else do you want us to do?

322
00:10:43,560 --> 00:10:44,960
Brother Jianshe is right.

323
00:10:44,960 --> 00:10:46,490
I'll take responsibility.

324
00:10:47,760 --> 00:10:48,220
Xiao Qi.

325
00:10:48,520 --> 00:10:50,520
I'll reimburse you for the cameras you bought.

326
00:10:50,520 --> 00:10:51,520
Buy a few more.

327
00:10:51,560 --> 00:10:53,640
And I'll reprint the torn posters.

328
00:10:54,040 --> 00:10:54,640
Sister Hu.

329
00:10:55,160 --> 00:10:56,480
I'll pay for the extra security fees

330
00:10:56,480 --> 00:10:57,640
out of my income.

331
00:11:00,760 --> 00:11:01,480
Alright.

332
00:11:02,160 --> 00:11:03,560
That's the end of it.

333
00:11:04,040 --> 00:11:04,600
Let's go.

334
00:11:10,960 --> 00:11:11,600
Manager.

335
00:11:11,600 --> 00:11:12,080
Sister.

336
00:11:12,080 --> 00:11:12,920
Do you have a minute?

337
00:11:12,920 --> 00:11:14,320
We have something very important to tell you.

338
00:11:14,320 --> 00:11:14,850
Go ahead.

339
00:11:15,680 --> 00:11:16,920
The person who attacked Bai Feixin

340
00:11:16,920 --> 00:11:18,480
is definitely not from the official fan club.

341
00:11:18,480 --> 00:11:20,120
But they came prepared.

342
00:11:20,320 --> 00:11:22,280
You can't be on guard forever.

343
00:11:22,280 --> 00:11:22,760
What do you mean?

344
00:11:22,760 --> 00:11:24,280
Sister, we found out

345
00:11:24,560 --> 00:11:26,960
that someone has been secretly selling Jinxi's schedule.

346
00:11:26,960 --> 00:11:28,360
I have screenshots here.

347
00:11:30,840 --> 00:11:33,040
Do you know who is selling the schedule?

348
00:11:33,120 --> 00:11:33,920
We don't know.

349
00:11:34,040 --> 00:11:35,360
His identity is confidential.

350
00:11:35,360 --> 00:11:36,560
But we have already emphasized

351
00:11:36,560 --> 00:11:37,880
to all the fans in the fan club

352
00:11:37,880 --> 00:11:39,920
not to buy schedules from him anymore.

353
00:11:39,920 --> 00:11:41,080
To protect our brother,

354
00:11:41,080 --> 00:11:43,040
we stayed up all night to create a 5,000-word

355
00:11:43,040 --> 00:11:45,240
safety investigation report on Jin Xi.

356
00:11:45,480 --> 00:11:46,280
Look, sister.

357
00:11:48,320 --> 00:11:49,920
As expected of a top student.

358
00:11:52,240 --> 00:11:52,880
Producer: Zhang Yawei

359
00:11:52,880 --> 00:11:54,140
Producer: Zhang Yawei

360
00:11:57,240 --> 00:11:58,240
Alright.

361
00:11:59,120 --> 00:12:00,440
Shuai, will this work?

362
00:12:05,040 --> 00:12:07,320
First of all, congratulations on making it to the second round of interviews.

363
00:12:07,320 --> 00:12:09,050
Your profile is very complete.

364
00:12:09,120 --> 00:12:10,480
I have no further questions on my end.

365
00:12:10,480 --> 00:12:12,280
Do you have any questions for me?

366
00:12:12,480 --> 00:12:15,120
We will sign a formal adoption agreement, right?

367
00:12:15,120 --> 00:12:15,720
Of course.

368
00:12:16,680 --> 00:12:18,080
Then I have no questions.

369
00:12:18,320 --> 00:12:19,320
Andy Liu.

370
00:12:19,800 --> 00:12:22,260
I will notify you as soon as there is any news.

371
00:12:29,120 --> 00:12:30,580
I haven't seen you around.

372
00:12:30,960 --> 00:12:32,160
What are you here for?

373
00:12:32,840 --> 00:12:34,840
I'm here for the second round of interviews.

374
00:12:34,840 --> 00:12:36,440
Second round of interviews?

375
00:12:37,040 --> 00:12:38,360
Is our theater troupe hiring new people?

376
00:12:38,360 --> 00:12:40,220
How come I didn't know about this?

377
00:12:41,880 --> 00:12:43,040
Who told you to come?

378
00:12:43,040 --> 00:12:43,840
The director.

379
00:12:44,960 --> 00:12:45,640
Boss Wu.

380
00:12:46,760 --> 00:12:47,760
You mean Uncle Wu?

381
00:12:47,760 --> 00:12:48,920
Uncle Wu?

382
00:12:49,840 --> 00:12:51,440
Calling him so affectionately?

383
00:12:51,440 --> 00:12:52,880
Because he is my uncle.

384
00:12:52,880 --> 00:12:54,280
I'm his own niece.

385
00:12:54,760 --> 00:12:56,240
So you have connections.

386
00:12:57,560 --> 00:12:59,560
Which play are you auditioning for?

387
00:12:59,560 --> 00:13:00,520
Which role?

388
00:13:00,520 --> 00:13:01,080
I...

389
00:13:01,240 --> 00:13:02,560
What did you major in before?

390
00:13:02,560 --> 00:13:04,440
How old are you, and what school do you go to?

391
00:13:04,440 --> 00:13:05,280
How old are you really?

392
00:13:05,280 --> 00:13:07,080
Are you a musical theater major?

393
00:13:11,480 --> 00:13:12,160
Feixin.

394
00:13:12,600 --> 00:13:13,440
Don't worry too much.

395
00:13:13,440 --> 00:13:15,840
This might not have anything to do with you.

396
00:13:18,120 --> 00:13:18,640
Hello.

397
00:13:21,320 --> 00:13:21,960
Lin Yimin.

398
00:13:23,840 --> 00:13:24,560
So,

399
00:13:25,160 --> 00:13:26,080
did your mom tell you

400
00:13:26,080 --> 00:13:27,740
how many kittens you can keep?

401
00:13:27,760 --> 00:13:29,290
My mom said I can keep three.

402
00:13:29,480 --> 00:13:30,360
You said before

403
00:13:30,640 --> 00:13:32,640
that you raised chicks and turtles.

404
00:13:32,960 --> 00:13:34,290
So are they still alive?

405
00:13:34,360 --> 00:13:35,560
Well, they were alive.

406
00:13:35,560 --> 00:13:36,560
It's just that...

407
00:13:36,880 --> 00:13:38,520
The chick grew wings

408
00:13:38,520 --> 00:13:40,040
and flew out the window.

409
00:13:40,040 --> 00:13:41,320
The turtle sneaked out of the fish tank,

410
00:13:41,320 --> 00:13:43,600
and my dad didn't find it until three months later.

411
00:13:43,600 --> 00:13:45,260
It turned into a dried turtle.

412
00:13:46,320 --> 00:13:48,400
But that was back in elementary school.

413
00:13:48,400 --> 00:13:51,600
I will be responsible for these three lives in the future.

414
00:13:51,760 --> 00:13:52,560
Okay, I see.

415
00:13:53,160 --> 00:13:55,290
Do you have any other questions for me?

416
00:13:55,760 --> 00:13:57,160
I really like Jin Xi.

417
00:13:57,560 --> 00:13:58,040
Miss,

418
00:13:58,280 --> 00:14:00,540
can you help me get a photo with her later?

419
00:14:00,760 --> 00:14:01,320
Thank you.

420
00:14:01,320 --> 00:14:01,920
Thank you.

421
00:14:04,680 --> 00:14:05,280
Sister Hu.

422
00:14:05,760 --> 00:14:07,280
What's so mysterious

423
00:14:07,520 --> 00:14:09,450
that you didn't even invite Eason?

424
00:14:19,680 --> 00:14:20,480
What's wrong?

425
00:14:24,480 --> 00:14:27,760
Ever since Bai Feixin was attacked last time,

426
00:14:28,080 --> 00:14:30,280
I hired a professional to investigate.

427
00:14:30,520 --> 00:14:32,120
I wouldn't have known if I hadn't investigated.

428
00:14:32,120 --> 00:14:34,680
You are practically living in a nightmare.

429
00:14:35,480 --> 00:14:36,210
Did you know?

430
00:14:36,640 --> 00:14:37,760
In our company,

431
00:14:37,760 --> 00:14:41,290
someone is selling your itinerary information at a high price.

432
00:14:41,320 --> 00:14:42,120
No way.

433
00:14:42,120 --> 00:14:42,520
Yes.

434
00:14:44,040 --> 00:14:44,440
Look.

435
00:14:45,240 --> 00:14:47,080
ID information is 20 each,

436
00:14:47,320 --> 00:14:49,120
flight information is 50 each,

437
00:14:49,480 --> 00:14:51,240
and accommodation information is 100 each.

438
00:14:51,240 --> 00:14:52,040
The monthly itinerary,

439
00:14:52,040 --> 00:14:53,900
direct from the studio, is 2,000.

440
00:14:54,320 --> 00:14:56,120
Isn't this money too easy to make?

441
00:14:56,120 --> 00:14:58,720
It took me a lot of effort to buy this yesterday.

442
00:14:59,520 --> 00:15:01,580
Is it really someone from our studio?

443
00:15:02,280 --> 00:15:04,520
I've been planning this for a long time.

444
00:15:04,520 --> 00:15:07,050
The itinerary they each received is the same,

445
00:15:07,640 --> 00:15:10,160
but I made different marks on them.

446
00:15:10,640 --> 00:15:12,570
We'll know who it is once we open it.

447
00:15:12,880 --> 00:15:13,320
Look.

448
00:15:19,640 --> 00:15:20,680
Did you bring the money?

449
00:15:20,680 --> 00:15:21,940
This is too expensive.

450
00:15:22,120 --> 00:15:23,920
Is 2,500 really that expensive?

451
00:15:24,520 --> 00:15:25,880
What are you guys doing?

452
00:15:29,240 --> 00:15:30,080
Don't run!

453
00:15:30,320 --> 00:15:31,320
Stop right there!

454
00:15:32,080 --> 00:15:32,940
Who is this guy?

455
00:15:35,320 --> 00:15:36,320
You won't tell me?

456
00:15:36,760 --> 00:15:38,880
If you don't, I'll tell Sister Hu everything about you.

457
00:15:38,880 --> 00:15:40,120
We don't know who he is either.

458
00:15:40,120 --> 00:15:42,050
He told us to call him Brother Tian.

459
00:15:45,520 --> 00:15:46,780
What's wrong, Sister?

460
00:15:47,760 --> 00:15:48,680
Why meet here?

461
00:15:52,640 --> 00:15:54,300
How long have you been with me?

462
00:15:54,840 --> 00:15:55,900
About three years.

463
00:15:57,120 --> 00:15:58,240
In our company.

464
00:15:58,840 --> 00:16:01,300
You are actually the person I trust the most.

465
00:16:03,120 --> 00:16:05,320
Ever since I marked the itineraries

466
00:16:05,320 --> 00:16:06,920
and narrowed down the scope.

467
00:16:07,120 --> 00:16:08,050
Unfortunately,

468
00:16:08,240 --> 00:16:11,120
this suspect is not in the Xiyin Troupe,

469
00:16:11,960 --> 00:16:13,320
but in our company.

470
00:16:16,520 --> 00:16:17,560
So,

471
00:16:19,280 --> 00:16:21,140
can I still continue to trust you?

472
00:16:21,680 --> 00:16:22,440
Sister.

473
00:16:23,840 --> 00:16:24,560
I swear,

474
00:16:24,960 --> 00:16:27,560
I am completely loyal to you and Brother Jinxi.

475
00:16:28,440 --> 00:16:30,960
I would absolutely never do anything to betray you guys.

476
00:16:30,960 --> 00:16:31,890
Absolutely not.

477
00:16:35,160 --> 00:16:35,760
Good.

478
00:16:36,640 --> 00:16:38,080
Then follow me

479
00:16:38,360 --> 00:16:40,680
and let's root out this person selling the itineraries.

480
00:16:40,680 --> 00:16:41,440
Okay.

481
00:16:46,880 --> 00:16:48,560
After careful consideration,

482
00:16:48,560 --> 00:16:51,160
you are the final adopter of the three kittens.

483
00:16:51,840 --> 00:16:52,840
Thank you so much.

484
00:16:54,520 --> 00:16:56,720
We can start signing the agreement now.

485
00:17:17,119 --> 00:17:18,119
Your name is...

486
00:17:20,040 --> 00:17:20,960
Zhang Naitian.

487
00:17:21,240 --> 00:17:21,599
Yes.

488
00:17:22,160 --> 00:17:23,760
Andy is just my English name.

489
00:17:27,440 --> 00:17:28,079
Excuse me.

490
00:17:36,200 --> 00:17:36,560
Yes.

491
00:17:37,560 --> 00:17:38,490
The usual price.

492
00:17:39,760 --> 00:17:41,690
See you at the usual place tonight.

493
00:17:41,960 --> 00:17:43,120
We don't know who he is either.

494
00:17:43,120 --> 00:17:44,280
He told us to call him Brother Tian.

495
00:17:44,280 --> 00:17:45,940
Let's leave it at that for now.

496
00:17:47,920 --> 00:17:48,480
Let's continue.

497
00:17:48,480 --> 00:17:49,080
Sorry.

498
00:17:49,080 --> 00:17:50,410
Something just came up.

499
00:17:50,440 --> 00:17:51,770
Let's sign it next time.

500
00:17:52,120 --> 00:17:53,320
Didn't we already...

501
00:18:21,360 --> 00:18:23,120
Why did you ask me to meet you on the roof?

502
00:18:23,120 --> 00:18:24,050
I'm not like you.

503
00:18:24,320 --> 00:18:26,250
I don't need to hide in the shadows.

504
00:18:27,040 --> 00:18:28,500
I don't know what you mean.

505
00:18:28,520 --> 00:18:29,120
Director Ning Jin

506
00:18:29,120 --> 00:18:30,960
saw you selling his information with her own eyes.

507
00:18:30,960 --> 00:18:32,680
She didn't see your face clearly,

508
00:18:32,680 --> 00:18:35,140
but she knows the fans call you Brother Tian.

509
00:18:35,560 --> 00:18:36,520
Zhang Naitian.

510
00:18:37,160 --> 00:18:38,020
Isn't that you?

511
00:18:39,320 --> 00:18:41,040
Besides, you have a subconscious habit

512
00:18:41,040 --> 00:18:42,500
that you can't hide at all.

513
00:18:42,880 --> 00:18:44,410
You like to slap your thigh.

514
00:18:45,320 --> 00:18:46,250
Give me a chance.

515
00:18:46,680 --> 00:18:48,140
How can I give you a chance?

516
00:18:48,760 --> 00:18:50,320
I didn't have a choice before.

517
00:18:50,320 --> 00:18:51,920
Now I want to be a good person.

518
00:18:53,640 --> 00:18:54,120
Fine.

519
00:18:54,920 --> 00:18:55,850
Go ask Sister Hu.

520
00:18:56,560 --> 00:18:57,560
See if she agrees.

521
00:19:02,120 --> 00:19:03,160
Don't come any closer.

522
00:19:03,160 --> 00:19:04,120
My name is not Andy.

523
00:19:04,120 --> 00:19:04,960
I don't want to get caught.

524
00:19:04,960 --> 00:19:05,840
Are you crazy?

525
00:19:05,840 --> 00:19:06,760
You are insane.

526
00:19:07,200 --> 00:19:08,800
Why are you taking a hostage?

527
00:19:09,120 --> 00:19:10,980
I'm not sending you to the police.

528
00:19:11,040 --> 00:19:12,760
You're not calling the police?

529
00:19:12,760 --> 00:19:13,960
I came to inform you

530
00:19:13,960 --> 00:19:15,020
that you are fired.

531
00:19:15,240 --> 00:19:15,800
Leave now.

532
00:19:15,800 --> 00:19:17,260
Don't let me see you again.

533
00:19:17,840 --> 00:19:18,280
I...

534
00:19:18,440 --> 00:19:19,440
Thank you, Ms. Hu.

535
00:19:23,760 --> 00:19:24,520
Are you okay?

536
00:19:25,080 --> 00:19:25,610
I'm fine.

537
00:19:26,240 --> 00:19:27,040
I'm sorry.

538
00:19:27,360 --> 00:19:28,560
I doubted you before.

539
00:19:28,960 --> 00:19:31,160
I am absolutely loyal to you and Jinxi.

540
00:19:31,560 --> 00:19:32,680
So are we to you.

541
00:19:33,320 --> 00:19:34,040
By the way,

542
00:19:34,240 --> 00:19:35,760
I recently wrote a new song.

543
00:19:35,760 --> 00:19:36,890
Can you listen to it?

544
00:19:37,280 --> 00:19:38,120
It's a folk song.

545
00:19:38,120 --> 00:19:38,480
I...

546
00:19:38,480 --> 00:19:38,880
Hello?

547
00:19:39,680 --> 00:19:41,040
Okay.

548
00:19:41,040 --> 00:19:42,570
Your phone didn't light up.

549
00:19:43,080 --> 00:19:43,520
Sister,

550
00:19:43,520 --> 00:19:43,920
you...

551
00:19:44,480 --> 00:19:45,680
Wait for me.

552
00:19:45,840 --> 00:19:47,400
One, two, three.

553
00:19:50,120 --> 00:19:50,440
Look.

554
00:19:50,440 --> 00:19:51,760
Mom, you took a great photo.

555
00:19:51,760 --> 00:19:52,680
Thank you guys.

556
00:19:54,240 --> 00:19:54,970
Keep it down.

557
00:19:57,240 --> 00:19:58,640
They are so small.

558
00:19:58,640 --> 00:19:59,560
So cute.

559
00:19:59,560 --> 00:20:00,840
They will grow up quickly,

560
00:20:00,840 --> 00:20:01,640
just like you.

561
00:20:02,880 --> 00:20:03,960
I will play with them every day

562
00:20:03,960 --> 00:20:05,240
and take good care of them.

563
00:20:05,240 --> 00:20:06,920
Right, the kittens don't have names yet.

564
00:20:06,920 --> 00:20:07,320
Jinxi,

565
00:20:07,480 --> 00:20:09,160
can you name them?

566
00:20:10,280 --> 00:20:11,480
How about

567
00:20:11,480 --> 00:20:13,560
Makuna, Matata, and Simba?

568
00:20:14,760 --> 00:20:15,480
No.

569
00:20:15,600 --> 00:20:16,660
That's a mouthful.

570
00:20:17,120 --> 00:20:18,120
What do you think?

571
00:20:18,480 --> 00:20:19,760
Their mom's name is Jinzi.

572
00:20:19,760 --> 00:20:23,220
So they should be called Jin Damao, Jin Ermao, and Jin Xiaomao.

573
00:20:23,960 --> 00:20:25,120
Good thing you're a director,

574
00:20:25,120 --> 00:20:26,250
not a screenwriter.

